    {
      "cell": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "# Nemotron-3-Nano LoRA SFT — Tong Hui Kang Style CoT Reproduction"
    },
    {
      "cell": 0,
      "line": 5,
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "After [Tong Hui Kang's brilliant 0.85 solution](https://www.kaggle.com/code/huikang/tinker-submission-notebook) was published,"
    },
    {
      "cell": 0,
      "line": 8,
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "**Approach**: This notebook follows option 1 — adopt Tong's SFT methodology and recreate his deterministic CoT traces programmatically."
    },
    {
      "cell": 0,
      "line": 11,
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "- **Deterministic CoT generation** for all 7 categories (GC, NC, UC, TE, BM, ET Numeric, Cryptarithm)"
    },
    {
      "cell": 0,
      "line": 15,
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "- **354-candidate per-bit testing + stride detection** for BM"
    },
    {
      "cell": 0,
      "line": 18,
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "- **1st-place training hyperparameters**: LR=2e-4, batch=64, 1 epoch, linear decay, no boxed weight, no NEFTune"
    },
    {
      "cell": 0,
      "line": 21,
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "- **Mamba gate_proj + x_proj → in_proj SVD merging** (Tinker-specific)"
    },
    {
      "cell": 0,
      "line": 22,
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "- **min logprob < -0.69 detection and CoT iteration** (requires Tinker dashboard)"
    },
    {
      "cell": 0,
      "line": 24,
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "- **Perfect Tinker training infrastructure** (8 sec/step vs my 60+ sec/step)"
    },
    {
      "cell": 0,
      "line": 28,
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "**please upvote [Tong's original notebook](https://www.kaggle.com/code/huikang/tinker-submission-notebook) first** — it's the perfect, original work."
    },
    {
